QuotaRoom
=========

QuotaRoom (Chinese: 额度空间) is an Android and Windows desktop Flutter port
and rebrand of GoGauge:

  GoGauge (opencode-go-gauge)
  Copyright (c) 2026 GoGauge (yphyphyph)
  https://github.com/yphyphyph/opencode-go-gauge
  Licensed under the MIT License.

QuotaRoom is a community project and is not an official release from the
upstream author. The upstream Python Windows desktop application is a separate
project and is not included in this repository; the Windows client here is an
independent Flutter implementation sharing QuotaRoom's codebase.

A pre-rebrand GoGauge Mobile build (package com.gogauge.gogauge_mobile) was
published at https://github.com/StarryCognet/gogauge-mobile. QuotaRoom uses a
new package id (com.starrycognet.quotaroom) and is a separate application.

Rebranding and changes:
- New product name "QuotaRoom" / "额度空间", package id
  com.starrycognet.quotaroom, and an original capacity-tank app icon
  (a tank with a liquid level; the empty space above is the "room").
- UI rewritten with Flutter/Dart (bottom navigation on mobile, a wide-screen
  navigation rail on desktop, charts, light/dark themes, Chinese/English UI).
- opencode.ai console API client, quota parsing, SQLite aggregations and the
  incremental/full sync cursor logic ported from Python to Dart.
- Android in-app WebView login with a native CookieManager bridge for the
  HttpOnly session cookie, plus a manual "paste cookie" fallback.
- Session cookies stored in Android Keystore-backed secure storage instead of
  the SQLite database; on Windows they use the Windows Credential Manager key
  plus AES-GCM encrypted files.
- Windows desktop runner with FFI SQLite, system-browser + cookie login,
  Windows toast notifications and desktop save dialogs.
- Added an extra `created_ms` column so date/hour bucketing does not depend on
  SQLite's ISO-8601 timezone parsing.
- Bundled MIT license viewer inside the app (About -> Open Source Licenses).

The MIT license text and the upstream copyright notice are preserved in the
LICENSE file, which is also bundled as assets/LICENSE in the APK.

